---
layout: page
layoutType: postcard-archive
title: "100 Postcards"
permalink: "/100-postcard-paintings/index.html"
---


<header class="postcard-archive__header">
  <h1>100 Postcard Paintings</h1>

  
    <p>
      I'm painting 100 paintings on postcard-sized paper
      and mailing them to friends and strangers around the world.
    </p>
    <p>
      My only request: photograph the postcard when it arrives and send me the image.
      I will compile those pictures into a book.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you'd like an original postcard painting in your mailbox,
      email me at postcard (at) this domain.
    </p>
    <p class="postcard-legend"><span class="postcard-position__received" aria-hidden="true"></span> arrived and photographed</p>
</header>


<ol class="postcard-grid" >
  {% for id in 1 | numberRange(100) %}
    {% set postcard = postcards | postcardById(id) %}
    <li id="{{ id | postcardId }}" class="postcard-position{% if postcard %} postcard-position--recorded postcard-position--{{ postcard.status }}{% else %} postcard-position--empty{% endif %}">
      {% if postcard %}
        <a href="/100-postcard-paintings/{{ postcard.id | postcardId }}/" aria-label="Postcard #{{ postcard.id | postcardId }}{% if postcard.title %}: {{ postcard.title }}{% endif %}">
          <span class="postcard-position__image">
            {% if postcard.painting.thumbnail | assetExists %}
              <img
                src="{{ postcard.painting.thumbnail }}"
                alt="Postcard painting #{{ postcard.id | postcardId }}{% if postcard.title %}, {{ postcard.title }}{% endif %}"
                loading="lazy"
              >
            {% else %}
              <span class="postcard-position__image-pending" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            {% endif %}
          </span>
          <span class="postcard-position__number">#{{ postcard.id | postcardId }}{% if postcard.status == "received" %}<span class="postcard-position__received" title="Received"><span class="visually-hidden">, received</span></span>{% endif %}</span>
        </a>
      {% else %}
        <span class="postcard-position__image" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="postcard-position__number">#{{ id | postcardId }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>

